Cell[BoxData["\<\"myMission is valid basis. The definitions of the basis will \
be saved in \\\"Bases/myMission\\\" directory.\\n    Ds[myMission] \
\[LongDash] denominators,\\n    SPs[myMission] \[LongDash] scalar products \
involving loop momenta,\\n    LMs[myMission] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n    \
EMs[myMission] \[LongDash] external momenta,\\n    Parameters[myMission] \
\[LongDash] parameters (invariants, masses, dimension),\\n    Toj[myMission] \
\[LongDash] rules to transform scalar products to denominators,\\n    \
CutDs[myMission] \[LongDash] flag vector of cut denominators.\"\>"], "Print",
