immediate subsector is zero),\\n    ZerojRule[myMission3] \[LongDash] a rule \
to nullify all zero j[myMission3\[Ellipsis]],\\n    CutDs[myMission3] \
\[LongDash] a flag list of cut denominators (1=cut).\"\>"], "Print",
